      "You were given the dream — not them. Younger me, allow yourself to be misunderstood without needing to explain yourself so damn much. Take a chance on yourself without permission — we never regretted it!",
      "You Won’t Do It Alone",
      "You might think you have to build it all by yourself at first. But that’s not how big dreams work — they are carried by many. You’ll find your people. Your co-founder. Your teams. You’ll learn to trust others with the vision — and that starts by using your voice.",
      "Expansion Won’t Always Look Pretty",
      "The messy middle will be difficult. It’s not going to feel smooth and put together all the time. But it will make you more resilient. It’ll teach you how to fall and still get up wiser.",
